title = "It Is Getting Worse On a Schedule"
priority = 70
lede = "{era_text}. Outside temperature {temperature}."
body = "The survey team who wrote the climate pages left before the first winter and their numbers were taken from a summer. The real curve is steeper and it is not finished.

This is the part where a city either has margin or discovers that it does not. There are {buildings} structures standing and the grid is short by {heat_deficit}."
